        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandih rianra duidai khou hei,",
            "Ai rui ringhpui tuang Nangna de;",
            "He! Kanloumei Pu laukhuan gaanphiu gaimei,",
            "Nthiammei rui muangh zinghpui kum guang sini,",
            "Guang gaan o rianra zinghpui ram khou.",
            "",
            "He! Rianra rianriumei pang thang tei,",
            "Lily munpuang gaipui ram khou tei;",
            "Neihla mbaanthaipui ram khou;",
            "Zaigut lou o gaipui ram khou tei.",
            "",
            "2. Zaukim makmei Zion luangbut,",
            "Kanlou mei champan thiu bam e;",
            "Neihla na mpuan nthanmei liu bam e,",
            "Tingkauh Lauziu Na kaguangh bampang hu khou,",
            "Rinara zinghmei naidat pulak khe.",
            "",
            "3. Zau lo! Zion luangbut gaimei,",
            "Sa ngam makge karam gai tei;",
            "He! Tingkauh Nthanmei nun rui thuanku e,",
            "Ning nthuk ge “He! Hallelujah” tuna,",
            "Tingkauh Lauziu douluai kanmei tei."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
